# local env files
# `.env` is listed as well as `.env*.local`: this app keeps its machine-specific API base
# URL and Cognito client ids in a plain `.env`, and while none of those are secrets, a
# committed one silently overrides every other developer's LAN IP. `.env.example` is the
# tracked copy.
.env
.env*.local

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
